                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}P(\\text{total of }4)&=\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\\\P(\\text{total of }4)&=\\frac{3}{36}\\\\P(\\text{total of }4)&=\\frac{1}{12}\\end{aligned}",
